# DevTrack

A developer analytics dashboard that turns a GitHub username into a clear
picture of their work. Built with vanilla HTML, CSS and JavaScript, with no
frameworks, to focus on core web fundamentals.

**Live demo:** <your GitHub Pages link>

## Features
- Search any GitHub user and view their profile
- Fetch and display their public repositories
- Total stars and forks, plus a language distribution chart
- Sort by stars, forks or last updated; search and filter repositories
- Save favourite developers (stored in the browser with localStorage)
- Loading states and clear error handling (user not found, API rate limit, network errors)

## Tech
HTML, CSS, JavaScript (fetch, async/await), GitHub REST API, Chart.js